				title = Flight 101 - Crew: 1 Passengers: 4
				description = KSC Airlines is proud to offer air transportation service to the Island Airfield for KSC staff and visitors. Scientists and engineers often head out to the Island Airfield to work on various projects, and tourists to KSC know the island as one of the best places to camp out and watch launches.&br;&br;Fly out 4 passengers to the Island Airfield, wait 30 seconds to disembark and embark passengers, take off and return back to KSC.
				synopsis = This is a regular service round trip flight with no manual passenger exchange required. KSC Airlines regular flight service contracts are paid on a per-passenger basis.
