			subtype = SSI-10000m
			title = Fly an airplane to 10,000m.
			description = Inigma Kerman of SSI wants you to design and fly an aircraft capable of operating at an altitude of 10,000m. He says that such an accomplishment will make future air travel safer since most of Kerbin's serious weather only happens below this altitude. He says that if pilots could simply fly over bad weather rather than through it, it would unlock a large number of regional and possibly global air travel possibilities.
			synopsis = Simply launch an airplane from the runway, fly up to 10,000m, then land back at KSC safely.
			completedMessage = You did it! 10,000m reached, and your pilot snapped a great picture!&br;&br;While your pilot rests up at the Astronaut Complex, be sure to check in with Gene at Mission Control for another SSI opportunity if interested.
